editor_description = "Isolated cinematic runner. Press F6 with this scene open, or launch it directly, to jump straight to a beat without playing up to its trigger. It boots the real mining scene and drives the real controllers, so anything broken here is broken in the game too. 1 = surface arrival, 2 = layer breakthrough, 3 = depth encounter, R = replay, Esc = quit."
